  "_comment": "NOT used by the workflow. This is the previous full Jash Live feed (Tamil + Bigg Boss + all sports families, 43 sources) kept so nothing is lost. To build it instead, point the workflow's build step at this file; to merge both, add the star-sports source back to scripts/live-playlist.config.json.",
